Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.21,0:00:03.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: You know, I've been thinking about time travel again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.21,0:00:03.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一直在想时光旅行的事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.96,0:00:06.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why? Did you hit a roadblock with invisibility?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.96,0:00:06.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么？你遇到隐形路障了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.13,0:00:09.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Put it on the back burner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.13,0:00:09.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个先搁在一边
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.47,0:00:13.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, it occurs to me, if I ever did perfect a time machine...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.47,0:00:13.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总之 我想到如果我能做出完美的时光机
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.85,0:00:15.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I'd go into the past and give it to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.85,0:00:15.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会回到过去把它交给我自己
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.14,0:00:19.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thus eliminating the need for me to invent it in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.14,0:00:19.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那么我就不必发明了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.56,0:00:23.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Interesting. -Yeah, it really takes the pressure off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.56,0:00:23.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真有趣 -对 解除了我不少压力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.61,0:00:25.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sounds like a breakthrough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.61,0:00:25.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听起来是一大突破
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.02,0:00:28.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Should I call Science and tell them to hold the cover?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.02,0:00:28.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我该通知《科学杂志》请他们保留封面吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:31.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's time travel, Leonard. I will have done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:31.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这可是时光旅行 莱纳德 我当然会先你一步
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.07,0:00:34.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess congratulations are in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.07,0:00:34.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那我想我得恭喜你了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.12,0:00:39.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, congratulations will have been in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.12,0:00:39.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 你未来已经恭喜过我了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.25,0:00:41.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I'm not going to enjoy this party.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.25,0:00:41.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没办法在这个派对尽兴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.42,0:00:43.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: I know, I'm familiar with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.42,0:00:43.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道 我很了解你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.84,0:00:45.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: The last party, Professor Finkleday cornered me...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.84,0:00:45.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}上次我参加派对
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.54,0:00:48.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and talked about spelunking for 45 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.54,0:00:48.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}芬克戴教授缠着我聊了四十五分钟的深穴探险
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.05,0:00:50.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.05,0:00:50.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 我也在场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.26,0:00:52.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what's interesting about caves?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.26,0:00:52.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道洞穴最有趣的是什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.26,0:00:54.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What? -Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.26,0:00:54.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么？ -一点都不有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.47,0:00:59.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll avoid Finkleday, meet the new head, congratulate him, shake his hand and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.47,0:00:59.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们避开芬克戴 跟新老板见面 握手恭喜他 然后闪人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.02,0:01:02.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: How's this? "Pleased to meet you, Dr. Gablehauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.02,0:01:02.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这么说可以吗？“很高兴认识你 盖博豪瑟博士”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.15,0:01:06.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How fortunate for you the university has chosen to hire you...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.15,0:01:06.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“你非常幸运 学校选择聘用你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.19,0:01:09.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...despite the fact you've done no original research in 25 years...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.19,0:01:09.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然你已经二十五年没有原创性的研究
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.44,0:01:11.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and instead have written books...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.44,0:01:11.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只写了一些科普书
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.53,0:01:14.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that reduce the great concepts of science to anecdotes...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.53,0:01:14.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}将伟大的科学概念简化为趣闻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.62,0:01:15.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...each one dumbed down...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.62,0:01:15.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且通通都蠢到极点”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.99,0:01:19.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to accommodate the duration of an average bowel movement."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.99,0:01:19.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“所以才能成为一般人大便时的好读物”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.50,0:01:22.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SPEAKS IN HAWAIIAN]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.50,0:01:22.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}马哈洛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.21,0:01:27.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-"Mahalo" is a nice touch. -Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.21,0:01:27.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“马哈洛”能让场面轻松起来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.38,0:01:30.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Only eight consonants in the Hawaiian language.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.38,0:01:30.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}夏威夷语只有八个辅音
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.72,0:01:33.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: Interesting, you should lead with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.72,0:01:33.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真有趣 你可以用这个做开头
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.22,0:01:37.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God, look at this buffet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.22,0:01:37.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 看看这些自助餐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.06,0:01:39.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I love America.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.06,0:01:39.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我爱美国
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.06,0:01:44.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You don't have buffets in India? -Of course, but it's all Indian food.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.06,0:01:44.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-印度没有自助餐吗？ -当然有 但全部是印度菜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.60,0:01:47.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can't find a bagel in Mumbai to save your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.60,0:01:47.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在孟买可不是想吃百吉饼就能买到的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.61,0:01:49.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Smear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.61,0:01:49.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}帮我涂点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.86,0:01:53.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Well, here's an interesting turn of events. -What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.86,0:01:53.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这下可有趣了 -什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.62,0:01:57.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Howard brought a date?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.62,0:01:57.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德带了女伴来？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.08,0:02:02.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A more plausible explanation is that his work in robotics has made an amazing leap.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.08,0:02:02.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}比较可能的解释是他的机器人研究有了重大突破
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.71,0:02:06.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, what up, science bitches?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.71,0:02:06.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们好吗 科学呆子？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.25,0:02:10.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}May I introduce my special lady friend, Summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.25,0:02:10.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要跟你们介绍我的特别女友桑玛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.09,0:02:12.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Howard, I told you, touching's extra.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.09,0:02:12.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 我说过 摸要加钱的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.01,0:02:14.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.01,0:02:14.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.59,0:02:18.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here comes our new boss. Be polite.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.59,0:02:18.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}新老板来了 有点礼貌
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.30,0:02:19.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MAN: Hi, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.30,0:02:19.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.72,0:02:21.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Eric Gablehauser. -Howard Wolowitz.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.72,0:02:21.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-艾瑞克盖博豪瑟 -霍华德沃洛维茨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.77,0:02:24.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Howard, nice to meet you. And you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.77,0:02:24.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 真高兴认识你 你是哪位？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.48,0:02:27.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}An actual real scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.48,0:02:27.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是真正的不打折扣的科学家
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.02,0:02:32.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.02,0:02:32.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.90,0:02:36.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe he fired me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.90,0:02:36.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不敢相信他开除我了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.78,0:02:39.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You did call him a glorified science teacher...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.78,0:02:39.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说他只比中学科学老师高级一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.32,0:02:43.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...whose last successful experiment was lighting his own farts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.32,0:02:43.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他上次成功的实验是点火燃烧自己的屁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.37,0:02:48.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In my defense, I prefaced that by saying "with all due respect."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.37,0:02:48.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要帮自己辩解一下 我还说了“我无意冒犯”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.44,0:03:15.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.44,0:03:15.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}早安
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.74,0:03:17.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.74,0:03:17.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}早安
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.28,0:03:19.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're making eggs for breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.28,0:03:19.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在做早餐吃的鸡蛋？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.49,0:03:22.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This isn't breakfast, it's an experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.49,0:03:22.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这不是早餐 是实验
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.83,0:03:26.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Because it looks a lot like breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.83,0:03:26.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那看起来像早餐
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.20,0:03:30.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I finally have time to test my hypothesis about the separation of water molecules...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.20,0:03:30.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我终于有时间实验我的假设 将水分子…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.25,0:03:34.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...from the egg proteins and its impact vis-à-vis taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.25,0:03:34.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟鸡蛋的蛋白质分离 观察那对味道的影响
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.13,0:03:37.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sounds yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.13,0:03:37.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听起来很好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.68,0:03:39.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I look forward to your work with bacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.68,0:03:39.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很期待你对培根的研究
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.68,0:03:41.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}As do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.68,0:03:41.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也很期待
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.56,0:03:46.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I'm sure if you just apologize to Gablehauser he'd give your job back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.56,0:03:46.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我相信只要你跟盖博豪瑟道歉 他会让你复职
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.02,0:03:48.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't want my job back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.02,0:03:48.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我才不要复职
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.52,0:03:52.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've spent three and a half years staring at grease boards full of equations.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.52,0:03:52.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我花了三年半的时间盯着满是方程式的白板
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.61,0:03:55.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Before that, I spent four years working on my thesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.61,0:03:55.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在那之前 我花四年的时间写论文
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.19,0:03:59.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Before that, I was in college, and before that I was in the fifth grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.19,0:03:59.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再之前我在读大学 再之前我是五年级生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.95,0:04:04.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is my first day off in decades and I'm going to savor it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.95,0:04:04.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是我数十年来第一天放假 我要好好享受
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.12,0:04:08.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. I'll let you get back to fixing your eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.12,0:04:08.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我就不打扰你继续研究你的蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.16,0:04:11.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not just fixing my eggs, I'm fixing everyone's eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.16,0:04:11.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不只在研究我的蛋 我在研究大家的蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.92,0:04:14.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And we all thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.92,0:04:14.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们都很感激你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.09,0:04:17.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[DOOR CLOSES]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.73,0:04:35.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.99,0:04:48.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Use new eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.99,0:04:48.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}用新鲜的蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.29,0:04:49.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCK ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.83,0:04:53.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, I'm running out to the market. Do you guys need anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.83,0:04:53.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨 我要去市场 你们要买什么东西吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.04,0:04:56.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. This would be one of those circumstances...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.04,0:05:00.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在这种情况下 不熟悉大数法则的人会说这是巧合
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.71,0:05:00.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...people unfamiliar with the law of large numbers would call a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.42,0:05:02.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'm sorry? -I need eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.42,0:05:02.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你说什么？ -我需要鸡蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.34,0:05:04.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Four dozen should suffice. -Four dozen?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.34,0:05:04.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-四打应该够了 -四打？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.55,0:05:09.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Evenly distributed amongst brown, white, free-range, large, extra-large and jumbo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.55,0:05:09.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要平均分配于棕色、白色 散养鸡、大号、超大号、特大号
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.14,0:05:13.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Okay, one more time? -Never mind, you won't get it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.14,0:05:13.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好 再说一次？ -算了 你做不好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.02,0:05:16.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'd better come with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.02,0:05:16.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我最好跟你一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.61,0:05:18.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.53,0:05:24.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How come you didn't go in to work today?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.53,0:05:24.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么今天你不用上班？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.82,0:05:29.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm taking a sabbatical because I won't kowtow to mediocre minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.82,0:05:29.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在休假 因为我不懂得拍上司马屁
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.33,0:05:31.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you got canned, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.33,0:05:31.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以你被炒鱿鱼啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.54,0:05:34.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Theoretical physicists do not get canned.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.54,0:05:34.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}理论物理学家不会被炒鱿鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.17,0:05:36.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.17,0:05:36.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你说对了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.63,0:05:38.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe it's for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.63,0:05:38.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许这是件好事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.88,0:05:42.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I always say, "When one door closes, another one opens."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.88,0:05:42.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我常说 当一扇门关上了自然会有另一扇打开
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.51,0:05:44.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, it doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.51,0:05:44.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}才不会
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.72,0:05:46.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not unless the doors are connected by relays.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.72,0:05:46.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除非那两扇门有连线装置
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.97,0:05:49.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Or there are motion sensors involved. -No, I meant--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.97,0:05:49.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-或装了动作感应器 -不 我是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.56,0:05:54.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or if the first door closing creates a change of air pressure that acts upon the second.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.56,0:05:54.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或是第一扇门关起来时导致气压改变 影响了第二扇门
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.77,0:05:56.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.77,0:05:56.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}算了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.44,0:06:00.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Slow down. Slow down. Please, slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.44,0:06:00.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}慢一点 拜托你慢一点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.69,0:06:01.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.69,0:06:01.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们没事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.90,0:06:04.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're not leaving enough space between cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.90,0:06:04.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没有保持适当的行车安全距离
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.11,0:06:05.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, sure I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.11,0:06:05.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我当然有
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.32,0:06:07.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, let me do the math for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.32,0:06:07.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我算给你听
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.16,0:06:09.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This car weighs, let's say, 4000 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.16,0:06:09.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}假设这辆车重一千八百公斤
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.74,0:06:11.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, add 140 for me, 120 for you--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.74,0:06:11.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}加上我的64公斤跟你的55公斤…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.83,0:06:15.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-One-twenty? -Oh, I'm sorry, did I insult you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.83,0:06:15.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-55？ -对不起 我侮辱到你了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.04,0:06:18.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is your body mass somehow tied into your self-worth?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.04,0:06:18.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的体重跟自尊有关系吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.46,0:06:20.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.46,0:06:20.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.38,0:06:21.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.38,0:06:21.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.59,0:06:25.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, that gives us a total weight of, let's say, 4400 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.59,0:06:25.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总之假设总重量是一千九百公斤
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.14,0:06:27.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's say 4390.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.14,0:06:27.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}应该是一千八百九十五公斤
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.43,0:06:28.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.43,0:06:28.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.97,0:06:32.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're traveling forward at-- Good Lord. --51 miles an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.97,0:06:32.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们的速度是…天啊 时速八十二公里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.77,0:06:36.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's assume that your brakes are new and the calipers are aligned.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.77,0:06:36.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}假设你的刹车是新的 卡钳都没有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.10,0:06:37.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}By the time we come to a stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.10,0:06:37.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们刹车时
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.94,0:06:40.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...we'll be occupying the same space as that Buick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.94,0:06:40.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}仍然会跟前面那辆别克占据同一个空间
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.69,0:06:44.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}An impossibility that nature will quickly resolve into death, mutilation and--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.69,0:06:44.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这违反物理定律 所以大自然 会处理成当场死亡、残疾或是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.61,0:06:48.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, look, they built a new putt-putt course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.61,0:06:48.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看！他们盖了新的迷你高尔夫球场
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.62,0:06:52.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: This is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.62,0:06:52.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这真的是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.33,0:06:55.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look at me. I'm in the real world of ordinary people...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.33,0:06:55.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看看我 我来到平凡人的真实世界
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.33,0:06:59.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...just living their ordinary, colorless, work-a-day lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.33,0:06:59.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}过他们平凡无聊的日常生活
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:02.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Thank you. -No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:02.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢谢你 -不 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.92,0:07:06.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And thank you, ordinary person.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.92,0:07:06.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你 平凡人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.80,0:07:09.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, you wanna hear an interesting thing about tomatoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.80,0:07:09.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要听有关西红柿的趣事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.76,0:07:11.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.76,0:07:11.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不想听
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.10,0:07:14.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen, didn't you say you needed some eggs?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.10,0:07:14.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不是说你要买鸡蛋吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.14,0:07:17.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, but anyone who knows anything about bacterial growth...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.14,0:07:17.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 但了解细菌生长的人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.65,0:07:20.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...knows to pick up their refrigerated foods on the way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.65,0:07:20.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}都知道得在快离开时才拿冰过的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.98,0:07:23.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, okay, maybe you should start heading on out, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.98,0:07:23.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许你该离开了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.82,0:07:26.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, this is fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.82,0:07:26.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 这里很好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.99,0:07:29.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The thing about tomatoes, and I think you'll enjoy this...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.99,0:07:29.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}关于西红柿的趣事 我想你一定会喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.99,0:07:33.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is they're shelved with the vegetables, but they're technically a fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.99,0:07:33.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也就是它们被归为蔬菜类 事实上它们是水果
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.41,0:07:34.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hmm. Interesting. -Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.41,0:07:34.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真有趣 -对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.83,0:07:37.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I mean what you find enjoyable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.83,0:07:37.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我是指你觉得有趣的事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.92,0:07:43.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.92,0:07:43.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.84,0:07:46.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.84,0:07:46.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}又怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.68,0:07:49.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, there's some value to taking a multivitamin...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.68,0:07:49.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有些人建议吃综合维他命
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.39,0:07:51.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but the human body can only absorb so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.39,0:07:51.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但人体的吸收量有限
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.76,0:07:56.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What you're buying here are the ingredients for very expensive urine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.76,0:07:56.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你买的是非常昂贵的尿液成分
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.35,0:08:00.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, maybe that's what I was going for.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.35,0:08:00.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许那是我想做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.44,0:08:02.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, then you'll want some manganese.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.44,0:08:02.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那么你得买一些锰
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.86,0:08:10.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, that was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.86,0:08:10.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.62,0:08:13.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tomorrow we can go to one of those warehouse stores.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.62,0:08:13.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许明天我们可以去那些仓储式超市
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.24,0:08:14.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.24,0:08:14.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不确定 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.49,0:08:19.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's gonna take me a while to recover from all the fun I had today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.49,0:08:19.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今天那么好玩 我得花些时间才能恢复正常
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.29,0:08:22.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you sure? There are a lot of advantages to buying in bulk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.29,0:08:22.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你确定？大量采购真的很便宜
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.84,0:08:25.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For example, I noticed you purchase your tampons...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.84,0:08:25.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}譬如 我注意到你买卫生棉条…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.42,0:08:27.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...one month's supply at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.42,0:08:27.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一次只买一个月的量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.43,0:08:31.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What? -Well, think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.43,0:08:31.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么？ -仔细想一想
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.59,0:08:33.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It doesn't spoil...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.59,0:08:33.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那又不会坏掉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.18,0:08:37.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and you're going to be needing them for at least the next 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.18,0:08:37.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你至少未来三十年都还用得到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.22,0:08:40.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You want me to buy 30 years' worth of tampons?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.22,0:08:40.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要我买三十年的棉条？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.48,0:08:41.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, 30, 35--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.48,0:08:41.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}三十到三十五年…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.73,0:08:44.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-When did your mother go into menopause? -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.73,0:08:44.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你妈妈什么时候进入的更年期？ -好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.32,0:08:47.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not talking about this with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.32,0:08:47.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不要跟你谈这些事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.19,0:08:48.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.19,0:08:48.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.45,0:08:52.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is a natural human process and we're talking about significant savings.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.45,0:08:52.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是人体的自然变化 我们说的是省下一大笔钱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.53,0:08:56.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, if you assume 15 tampons per cycle in a 28-day cycle--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.53,0:08:56.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你在二十八天的周期里 每次用十五根棉条…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.41,0:08:58.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you fairly regular?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.41,0:08:58.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你都很准吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.08,0:09:07.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, no warehouse store, but we're still on for putt-putt golf, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.08,0:09:07.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 不去仓储式超市 但还是能去迷你高尔夫球场吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.30,0:09:12.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[DOOR OPENS]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.72,0:09:15.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, I just ran into Penny. She seemed upset about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.72,0:09:15.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我刚刚遇到佩妮 她似乎非常生气
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.68,0:09:18.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think it's her time of the month.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.68,0:09:18.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想她那个来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.35,0:09:23.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I marked the calendar for future reference.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.35,0:09:23.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在日历上做了标注 以便未来做参考
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.19,0:09:28.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's with the fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.19,0:09:28.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你干嘛养鱼？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.57,0:09:31.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's an experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.57,0:09:31.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是实验
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.53,0:09:35.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What happened to your egg research? -Oh, that was a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.53,0:09:35.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你的鸡蛋研究呢？ -没有结果
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.03,0:09:38.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Scrambled eggs are as good as they're ever going to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.03,0:09:38.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}炒蛋的味道永远都是那样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.29,0:09:41.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.29,0:09:41.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在是鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.21,0:09:46.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I read an article about scientists who inserted DNA from luminous jellyfish...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.21,0:09:46.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看过一篇文献 日本科学家将萤光水母的DNA
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.25,0:09:52.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...into other animals, and I thought, "Hey, fish nightlights."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.25,0:09:52.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}注入其他动物身体里 我就想到“鱼夜灯”
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.80,0:09:55.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fish nightlights.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.80,0:09:55.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}鱼夜灯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.64,0:09:58.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a billion-dollar idea. Shhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.64,0:09:58.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是价值十亿的点子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.56,0:10:00.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mum's the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.56,0:10:00.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不会说的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.31,0:10:06.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you sure you don't wanna just apologize to Gablehauser and get your job back?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.31,0:10:06.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你真的不跟盖博豪瑟道歉 让他给你复职吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.69,0:10:09.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no, no, no. No, I have too much to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.69,0:10:09.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我还有很多事要做
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.48,0:10:11.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like luminous fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.48,0:10:11.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}譬如萤光鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.78,0:10:14.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Shhh! -I'm sorry, I didn't....
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.78,0:10:14.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 我不…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.03,0:10:17.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's just the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.03,0:10:17.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那只是开始
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.66,0:10:21.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I also have an idea for a bulk, mail-order feminine hygiene company.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.66,0:10:21.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还计划成立批发邮购女性卫生用品公司
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.83,0:10:24.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, glow-in-the-dark tampons.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.83,0:10:24.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦 夜光卫生棉条
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.17,0:10:29.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, we're gonna be rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.17,0:10:29.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 我们要发财了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.05,0:10:36.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Thanks for coming on such short notice. -You did the right thing calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.05,0:10:36.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢谢你这么快赶过来 -你打电话给我是对的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.72,0:10:39.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't know what to do. He's lost all focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.72,0:10:39.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道该怎么办 他失去了生活重心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.10,0:10:42.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Every day, he's got a new obsession.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.10,0:10:42.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}每天他都有新点子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.11,0:10:50.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is a particularly disturbing one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.11,0:10:50.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个点子特别讨人厌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.53,0:10:55.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.53,0:10:55.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.45,0:10:58.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.45,0:10:58.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.16,0:11:01.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[MOUTHING] You called my mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.16,0:11:01.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你打电话给我妈？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.12,0:11:10.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you got yourself a loom. How nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.12,0:11:10.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你给自己弄了一架织布机 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.04,0:11:15.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Thank you. -Honey, why did you get a loom?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.04,0:11:15.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢谢 -甜心 为什么你需要织布机？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.38,0:11:20.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was working with luminous fish and I thought, "Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.38,0:11:20.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在研究萤光鱼 那时我想到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.64,0:11:22.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...loom."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.64,0:11:22.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“哦 织布机”
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.22,0:11:26.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mom, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.22,0:11:26.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈 你来这里做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.56,0:11:28.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard called me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.56,0:11:28.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德打电话给我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.15,0:11:30.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know, but why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.15,0:11:30.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.44,0:11:33.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because one of the great minds of the 21st century...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.44,0:11:33.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为二十一世纪最伟大的天才之一
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.07,0:11:36.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is raising glow-in-the-dark fish and weaving serapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.07,0:11:36.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在养萤光鱼跟织披肩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.99,0:11:39.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is not a serape. This is a poncho.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.99,0:11:39.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这不是披肩 这是斗蓬
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.41,0:11:42.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A serape is open at the sides, a poncho is closed. This is a poncho.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.41,0:11:42.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}披肩可以从侧面打开 斗蓬是密闭式的 这是斗蓬
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.74,0:11:47.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And neither is a reason to call someone's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.74,0:11:47.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但那都不是你打电话给我妈的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.42,0:11:49.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? When was the last time you left the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.42,0:11:49.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗？你上次出门是什么时候的事？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.50,0:11:52.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I went to the market with Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.50,0:11:52.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟佩妮去了超市
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.13,0:11:54.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, that was three weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.13,0:11:54.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 那是三星期前的事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.05,0:11:55.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, then, buckle up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.05,0:11:55.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那么你得小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.26,0:11:59.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In the next four to eight days, she's going to get very crabby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.26,0:11:59.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再过四到八天她会变得非常暴躁
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.10,0:12:03.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sweetheart, your little friend is concerned about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.10,0:12:03.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}甜心 你的小朋友是关心你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.89,0:12:05.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, well, I'm not a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.89,0:12:05.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 我不是小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.35,0:12:08.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm a grown man capable of living my life as I see fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.35,0:12:08.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是可以照自己心意过日子的大人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.60,0:12:12.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I certainly don't need someone telling on me to my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.60,0:12:12.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不需要朋友跟我妈打小报告！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.23,0:12:14.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.23,0:12:14.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下 你要去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.65,0:12:17.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To my room and no one's allowed in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.65,0:12:17.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}回我的房间 谁都不准进来！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.99,0:12:19.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[DOOR SLAMS]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.32,0:12:21.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-He gets his temper from his daddy. -Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.32,0:12:21.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他遗传了他爸爸的脾气
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.95,0:12:24.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-He's got my eyes. -I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.95,0:12:24.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他遗传了我的眼睛 -看得出来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.83,0:12:28.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All that science stuff, that comes from Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.83,0:12:28.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他的科学天分是耶稣基督给他的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.38,0:12:33.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, your mom made dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.38,0:12:33.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你妈妈做了晚餐！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.04,0:12:34.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: I'm not hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.04,0:12:34.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不饿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.25,0:12:37.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Leonard, don't trouble yourself. He's stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.25,0:12:37.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 别麻烦了 他很固执
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.34,0:12:39.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He may stay in there till the rapture.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.34,0:12:39.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他可以在那里待到他上天堂为止
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.01,0:12:43.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are we so sure that's a bad thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.01,0:12:43.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们确定这样不好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.43,0:12:45.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I love the boy to death...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.43,0:12:45.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我爱死我儿子了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.06,0:12:49.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but he has been difficult since he fell out of me at the Kmart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.06,0:12:49.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但自从他在超市里出生后一直都很难相处
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.14,0:12:52.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me for being so bold...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.14,0:12:52.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请恕我冒昧直言
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.69,0:12:56.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but I now see where Sheldon gets his smoldering good looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.69,0:12:56.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在我知道谢尔顿的美貌是遗传自谁了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.69,0:13:00.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Honey, that ain't gonna work, but you keep trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.69,0:13:00.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}甜心 那是没用的 但你可以继续说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.91,0:13:03.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I made chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.91,0:13:03.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我做了鸡肉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.91,0:13:08.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I hope that isn't one of the animals that you people think is magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.91,0:13:08.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}希望你们没把这种动物当成圣物
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.88,0:13:16.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, we have an Indian gentleman at our church.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.88,0:13:16.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的教会里有位印度先生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.67,0:13:19.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A Dr. Patel. It's a beautiful story.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.67,0:13:19.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}帕泰医生 那是个很棒的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.09,0:13:23.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The Lord spoke to him and moved him to give us all 20 percent off on LASEK.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.09,0:13:23.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}上帝跟他说话 说服他打八折 帮我们动激光近视矫正手术
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.64,0:13:25.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, those that needed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.64,0:13:25.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给那些有需要的人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.22,0:13:28.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That is a lovely story.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.22,0:13:28.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是个很棒的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.18,0:13:30.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are we gonna do anything about Sheldon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.18,0:13:30.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不该劝劝谢尔顿吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.10,0:13:32.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, we will. You have to take your time with Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.10,0:13:32.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们会的 你得给谢尔顿一些时间
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.81,0:13:35.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}His father, God rest his soul, used to say:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.81,0:13:35.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他爸爸 愿他的灵魂安息 以前常说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.15,0:13:38.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Mary, you have to take your time with Sheldon."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.15,0:13:38.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“玛丽 你得给谢尔顿一些时间”
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.19,0:13:42.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sounds like a wise man. -Oh, not so wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.19,0:13:42.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-听起来他很有智慧 -一点都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.20,0:13:45.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He once tried to fight a bobcat for some licorice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.20,0:13:45.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他曾为了甘草糖跟山猫打架
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.16,0:13:51.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So everybody grab a plate and a pretty placemat that Shelly wove.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.16,0:13:51.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家每人拿个盘子和谢尔顿织的漂亮餐垫
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.87,0:13:54.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Has Shelly ever freaked out like this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.87,0:13:54.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿以前像这样子崩溃过吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.38,0:13:55.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.38,0:13:55.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}常有的事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.58,0:13:57.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I remember one summer when he was 13...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.58,0:13:57.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我记得他十三岁的暑假
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.96,0:14:01.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...he built a small nuclear reactor in the shed...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.96,0:14:01.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他在小仓库里做了小型核子反应炉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.26,0:14:04.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and told everybody he was gonna provide electricity for the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.26,0:14:04.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他跟每个人说 他要提供免费的电给全镇使用
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.55,0:14:09.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, the only problem was, he had no, what you call, fissionable materials.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.55,0:14:09.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}问题是他没有所谓的可裂变材料
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.89,0:14:12.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, when he went on the Internet to get some...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.89,0:14:12.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总之他上网买了一些
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.81,0:14:17.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...a man from the government came by and sat him down real gentle...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.81,0:14:17.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}政府派人过来跟他坐下来好好谈了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.44,0:14:21.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and told him it's against the law to have yellow cake uranium in a shed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.44,0:14:21.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}告诉他在小仓库里放铀黄饼是违法的事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.57,0:14:24.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Well, what happened? -Well, poor boy had a fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.57,0:14:24.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-结果呢？ -那可怜的孩子发作了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.95,0:14:28.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Locked himself in his room and built a sonic death ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.95,0:14:28.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}关在自己的房里做音速死亡射线
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.08,0:14:31.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-A death ray? -Well, that's what he called it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.08,0:14:31.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-死亡射线？ -他是那么说的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.58,0:14:34.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Didn't even slow down the neighbor kids. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.58,0:14:34.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那连邻居家的孩子都对付不了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.29,0:14:37.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It pissed our dog off to no end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.29,0:14:37.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最后只惹毛了我们家的狗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.34,0:14:41.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, you two make a cute couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.34,0:14:41.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们两个在一起很搭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.88,0:14:42.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[BOTH LAUGH]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.09,0:14:44.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I-- No, no. No, we're not a couple. We're singles.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.09,0:14:44.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我…不
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.34,0:14:51.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Two singles. Like those individually wrapped slices of cheese that....
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.34,0:14:46.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我们不是情侣 我们两个都是单身
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.30,0:14:51.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}两个单身的人 像独立包装的起司片
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.35,0:14:54.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.35,0:14:54.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或是朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.02,0:14:56.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Did I pluck a nerve there? -Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.02,0:14:56.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我踩到痛处了吗？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.94,0:14:59.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. All right, everybody, it's time to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.94,0:14:59.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 大伙儿 开动了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.98,0:15:05.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Lord, we thank you for this meal and for all your bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.98,0:15:05.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天父 感谢你赐给我们食物跟富足的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.95,0:15:10.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And we pray that you help Sheldon get back on his rocker.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.95,0:15:10.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们祈祷你能帮助谢尔顿恢复正常
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.62,0:15:15.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, after a moment of silent meditation, I'm gonna end with "in Jesus' name"...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.62,0:15:15.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}经过短暂的沉默静思 最后我会说“以耶稣基督之名”
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.04,0:15:18.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but you two don't feel any obligation to join in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.04,0:15:18.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你们两个不一定要跟着我说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.34,0:15:23.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Unless, of course, the Holy Spirit moves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.34,0:15:23.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除非圣灵感动了你们
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.56,0:15:34.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God, this is the best cobbler I've ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.56,0:15:34.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 这是我吃过的最好吃的脆皮水果派
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.64,0:15:38.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was always Sheldon's favorite. You know what the secret ingredient is?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.64,0:15:38.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这一向是谢尔顿的最爱 你们知道秘方是什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.48,0:15:40.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Love? -Lard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.48,0:15:40.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-爱？ -猪油
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.28,0:15:48.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, look who's com-- -Shh. You'll spook him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.28,0:15:48.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-看看是谁… -嘘…你会吓到他的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.87,0:15:53.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's like a baby deer. You gotta let him come to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.87,0:15:53.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他跟小鹿一样 你得让他自己接近你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.79,0:16:03.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.79,0:16:03.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这太可笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.21,0:16:05.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Damn it, Sheldon, snap out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.21,0:16:05.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}该死 谢尔顿 振作一点
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.38,0:16:09.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're a physicist. You belong at the university doing research, not in your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.38,0:16:09.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是物理学家 你该到大学做研究 不是窝在屋里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.93,0:16:14.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[DOOR SLAMS]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.77,0:16:18.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't hunt, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.77,0:16:18.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不常打猎吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.77,0:16:24.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCK ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.78,0:16:28.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good morning, Snickerdoodle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.78,0:16:28.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}早安 我的小心肝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.15,0:16:29.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Morning. -Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.15,0:16:29.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}早安
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.53,0:16:32.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, that looks awful fancy. What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.53,0:16:32.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那看起来真不错 那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.53,0:16:39.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's my idea of what DNA would look like in a silicon-based life form.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.53,0:16:39.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是我想象中硅胶生物体的DNA
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.33,0:16:43.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But intelligently designed by a creator, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.33,0:16:43.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是造物主的神奇设计 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.59,0:16:46.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you want, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.59,0:16:46.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有什么事吗 妈妈？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.13,0:16:51.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know how your daddy used to say that you can only fish for so long...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.13,0:16:51.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道你爸常说钓鱼的时间到了一个极限
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.26,0:16:54.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...before you gotta throw a stick of dynamite in the water?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.26,0:16:54.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就得丢炸药去炸鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.30,0:16:57.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yeah? -Well, I'm done fishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.30,0:16:57.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-所以呢？ -我不想再钓鱼了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.18,0:17:01.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You put those on. -What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.18,0:17:01.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-快换上衣服 -为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.23,0:17:03.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because you're gonna go to your office...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.23,0:17:03.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为你要去你的办公室
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.27,0:17:05.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...apologize to your boss and get your job back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.27,0:17:05.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟你的老板道歉 想办法要回你的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.98,0:17:07.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No. -I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.98,0:17:07.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不 -对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.57,0:17:11.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did I start that sentence with the words "if it please Your Highness"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.57,0:17:11.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有说“如果王子殿下愿意的话”吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.41,0:17:16.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not going to. I didn't say anything that wasn't true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.41,0:17:16.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不去道歉 我说的话都是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.29,0:17:17.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, you listen here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.29,0:17:17.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你给我听好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.83,0:17:20.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have been telling you since you were 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.83,0:17:20.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}从你四岁开始我就这么告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.50,0:17:24.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's okay to be smarter than everybody, but you can't go around pointing it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.50,0:17:24.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以比其他人聪明 但你不必四处告诉别人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.63,0:17:27.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why not? -Because people don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.63,0:17:27.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-为什么不行？ -因为别人不喜欢听
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.05,0:17:31.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Remember all the ass-kickings from the neighbor kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.05,0:17:31.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还记得你常被邻居小孩欺负吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.60,0:17:36.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, let's get cracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.60,0:17:36.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们得开始干活了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.47,0:17:40.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Shower, shirt, shoes and let's shove off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.47,0:17:40.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}冲澡、穿上衬衫跟鞋子 然后出发
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.94,0:17:46.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wouldn't have been any ass-kickings if that stupid death ray had worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.94,0:17:46.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要是那个该死的死亡射线成功 我也不会被欺负
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.86,0:17:52.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Problem solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.86,0:17:52.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}问题解决了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.78,0:17:55.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? That's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.78,0:17:55.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗？真令人佩服
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.49,0:17:58.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, the Lord never gives us more than we can handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.49,0:17:58.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 上帝不会给我们无法应付的事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.45,0:18:01.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thankfully, he blessed me with two other children...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.45,0:18:01.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}感谢他给了我另外两个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.04,0:18:02.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...who are dumb as soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.04,0:18:02.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们笨得跟猪一样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.04,0:18:10.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me, Dr. Gablehauser, are you busy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.04,0:18:10.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 盖博豪瑟博士 你在忙吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.51,0:18:14.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Well, actually-- -Sheldon, he's just doodling. Get in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.51,0:18:14.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-事实上… -谢尔顿 他只是在涂鸦 快进来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.35,0:18:19.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Dr. Gablehauser. -Dr. Cooper.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.35,0:18:19.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-盖博豪瑟博士 -库珀博士
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.97,0:18:23.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's go, baby, we're losing daylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.97,0:18:23.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快点 宝贝 太阳快下山了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.36,0:18:27.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um....
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.82,0:18:32.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}As you know, several weeks ago in our first encounter...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.82,0:18:32.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道 几星期前我们第一次见面
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.15,0:18:34.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...we may have gotten off on the wrong foot...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.15,0:18:34.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当我说你白痴时
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.53,0:18:36.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...when I called you an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.53,0:18:36.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们之间或许有些误会
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.03,0:18:40.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I just wanted to say that I was wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.03,0:18:40.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想说我错了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.08,0:18:43.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to point it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.08,0:18:43.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不该讲出来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.66,0:18:46.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, we haven't been introduced.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.66,0:18:46.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 我们还不认识
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.92,0:18:50.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Dr. Eric Gablehauser. -Mary Cooper, Sheldon's mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.92,0:18:50.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-艾瑞克盖博豪瑟博士 -玛丽库珀 谢尔顿的妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.17,0:18:53.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, that's impossible. You must've had him when you were a teenager.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.17,0:18:53.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不可能 你怀他的时候一定还是个少女
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.63,0:18:56.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, aren't you sweet. His father's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.63,0:18:56.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真会说话 他爸死了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.85,0:19:00.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Recently? -Long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.85,0:19:00.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-最近吗？ -够久了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.60,0:19:03.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.60,0:19:03.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请坐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.10,0:19:06.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, shouldn't you be working?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.10,0:19:06.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你该去工作了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.44,0:19:12.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.44,0:19:12.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.86,0:19:18.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, how did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.86,0:19:18.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.78,0:19:20.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got my job back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.78,0:19:20.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我复职了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.20,0:19:22.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.20,0:19:22.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗？发生了什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.54,0:19:25.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not quite sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.54,0:19:25.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不是很确定
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.21,0:19:29.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It involves a part of the human experience that has always eluded me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.21,0:19:29.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟我一直很困惑的人类经验有关
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.96,0:19:32.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, that narrows it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.96,0:19:32.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那缩小了搜索范围
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.22,0:19:39.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm very proud of you, honey. You showed a lot of courage today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.22,0:19:39.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我非常以你为荣 甜心 今天的你非常有勇气
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.89,0:19:42.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.89,0:19:42.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢 妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.18,0:19:46.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Mom? -Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.18,0:19:46.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.27,0:19:51.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is Dr. Gablehauser going to be my new daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.27,0:19:51.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}盖博豪瑟博士会是我的新爸爸吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.53,0:19:57.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll see. Sleep tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.53,0:19:57.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}回头看看再说 好好睡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.69,0:20:35.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}译者： 杨博
